  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 21 × 5 – 35 + (42 ÷ 7) + 28 = 96 \n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the numbers :\n\nOption 1) 28 and 35\n\n21 × 5 – 35 + (42 ÷ 7) + 28 = 96 \n\n⇒ 21 × 5 – 28 + (42 ÷ 7) + 35 = 96\n\n⇒ 21 × 5 – 28 + __**(42 ÷ 7)**__ + 35 = 96 \n\n⇒ __**21 × 5**__ – 28 + 6 + 35 = 96\n\n⇒ __**105 + 6 + 35**__ – 28 = 96\n\n⇒ __**146 - 28**__ = 96\n\n⇒ 118 ≠ 96 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 35 and 42\n\n21 × 5 – 35 + (42 ÷ 7) + 28 = 96 \n\n⇒ 21 × 5 – 42 + (35 ÷ 7) + 28 = 96\n\n⇒ 21 × 5 – 42 + __**(35 ÷ 7)**__ + 28 = 96 \n\n⇒ __**21 × 5**__ – 42 + 5 + 28 = 96\n\n⇒ __**105 + 5 + 28**__ – 42 = 96\n\n⇒ __**138 - 42**__ = 96\n\n⇒ 96 = 96 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3) 21 and 42\n\n21 × 5 – 35 + (42 ÷ 7) + 28 = 96 \n\n⇒ 42 × 5 – 35 + (21 ÷ 7) + 28 = 96\n\n⇒ 42 × 5 – 35 + __**(21 ÷ 7)**__ + 28 = 96 \n\n⇒ __**42 × 5**__ – 35 + 3 + 28 = 96\n\n⇒ __**210 + 3 + 28**__ – 35 = 96\n\n⇒ __241** – 35**__ = 96\n\n⇒ 206 ≠ 96 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 28 and 21\n\n21 × 5 – 35 + (42 ÷ 7) + 28 = 96 \n\n⇒ 28 × 5 – 35 + (42 ÷ 7) + 21 = 96\n\n⇒ 28 × 5 – 35 + __**(42 ÷ 7)**__ + 21 = 96 \n\n⇒ __**28 × 5**__ – 35 + 6 + 21 = 96\n\n⇒ __**140 + 6 + 21**__ – 35 = 96\n\n⇒ __**167 – 35**__ = 96\n\n⇒ 132 ≠ 96 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
